		*m: apikey_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI APIKey property.
		*m: apikey_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the APIKey property.
		*m: apispec_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI APISpec property.
		*m: apispec_assign		&& Assign method used to hold the Chilkat AI APISpec property.
		*m: ask		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Sends the current potentially multimodal input within the context of the selected conversation and receives the model's output. Currently, the desired outputType can only be text.
		*m: askasync		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Creates an asynchronous task to call the Ask method with the arguments provided. Note: Async method event callbacks happen in the background thread.
		*m: baseurl_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI BaseURL property.
		*m: baseurl_assign		&& Assign method used to hold the Chilkat AI BaseURL property.
		*m: debuglogfilepath_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI DebugLogFilePath property.
		*m: debuglogfilepath_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the DebugLogFilePath property.
		*m: deleteconvo		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Deletes the conversation by its name. If name equals * then all conversations are deleted.
		*m: enablesecrets_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI EnableSecrets property.
		*m: enablesecrets_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the EnableSecrets property.
		*m: exportconvo		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Exports the conversation specified by name to json, replacing json's contents with the exported transcript. You can later import a conversation using ImportConvo.
		*m: fulltranscript_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI FullTranscript property.
		*m: fulltranscript_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the FullTranscript property.
		*m: getfunctioncalls		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. This method returns the function calls in json if the output contains any. Returns 1 if one or more function calls were returned, otherwise returns 0.
		*m: getlastjsondata		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Provides details about the last method called on this object instance.
		*m: getmodels		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Returns a list of models available to your account, such as GPT-4o and GPT-5. The models are listed in st, sorted in ascending, case-insensitive order. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: getmodelsasync		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Creates an asynchronous task to call the GetModels method with the arguments provided. Note: Async method event callbacks happen in the background thread. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*m: getoutputbd		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Returns in bd the binary output from the last call to Ask, such as for an AI generated image.
		*m: getoutputjson		&& Introduced in version 11.6.0. Returns the model's structured JSON output from the most recent Ask, parsed into json. Use this after setting a schema with SetOutputSchema . Returns 1 and populates json when the output is valid JSON.
		*m: getoutputtext		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Returns the text output from the last call to Ask. Returns Nothing on failure
		*m: getoutputtextsb		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Returns the text output, appended to sb, from the last call to Ask. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: getsearchresults		&& Introduced in version 11.6.0. Returns the web search sources the model used in the most recent Ask, if web search was enabled via the web_search param of SetAskParams .
		*m: hasfunctioncalls_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI HasFunctionCalls property.
		*m: hasfunctioncalls_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the HasFunctionCalls property.
		*m: heartbeatms_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI HeartBeatMs property.
		*m: heartbeatms_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the HeartbeatMs property.
		*m: hostedconvo_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI HostedConvo property.
		*m: hostedconvo_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the HostedConvo property.
		*m: idletimeoutms_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI IdleTimeoutMs property.
		*m: idletimeoutms_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the IdleTimeoutMs property.
		*m: importconvo		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Imports the conversation from json and assigns it the name in name.
		*m: inputaddfiledata		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Adds file data, such as a PDF, to the potentially multimodal input that will be sent in the next call to Ask. The bd contains the file data. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: inputaddfileid		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Adds a reference to a previously uploaded file. The file_id is the id returned from the provider when originally uploading the file.
		*m: inputaddfileurl		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Adds a file located at a url to the potentially multimodal input that will be sent in the next call to Ask. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: inputaddfnresult		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Provide a function call result to the model. This only applies to manual function tool calling, not automatic JS tool calls. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: inputaddimagedata		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Adds an image to the potentially multimodal input that will be sent in the next call to Ask. The bd contains the images data. The image data must be jpeg, png, or webp format. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: inputaddimagefileid		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Adds a reference to a previously uploaded image file. The file_id is the id returned from the provider when originally uploading the file.
		*m: inputaddimageurl		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Adds an image located at a url to the potentially multimodal input that will be sent in the next call to Ask. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: inputaddtext		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Adds text to the potentially multimodal input that will be sent in the next call to Ask. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: inputaddtextsb		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Adds text to the potentially multimodal input that will be sent in the next call to Ask. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: inputclear		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Clears the inputs to be sent in the next call to Ask.
		*m: jstooltimeout_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI JsToolTimeOut property.
		*m: jstooltimeout_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the JsToolTiimeOut property.
