		*m: lasterrortext_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastErrorText property.
		*m: lasterrorxml_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI LastErrorXML property.
		*m: lasterrorxml_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastErrorXML property.
		*m: lastmethodsuccess_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI LastMethodSuccess property.
		*m: lastmethodsuccess_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastMethodSuccess property.
		*m: lastresponserefused_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI LastResponseRefused property.
		*m: lastresponserefused_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastResponseRefused property.
		*m: laststringresultlen_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI LastStringResultLen property.
		*m: laststringresultlen_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastStringResultLen property.
		*m: laststringresult_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI LastStringResult property.
		*m: laststringresult_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastStringResult property.
		*m: listconvos		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Returns the full list of conversation names in st.
		*m: model_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI Model property.
		*m: model_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the Model property.
		*m: newconvo		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Creates and initializes a transcript for a new conversation. The name is a unique name for the conversation. You can reference the conversation by this name, such as for the ExportConvo method.
		*m: nextaievent		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. Retrieves the next available AI streaming mode response update. Use the PollAi method to check if a response update is immediately accessible. The event name is returned in sbName. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: pollai		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. If abort is 1, then the streaming response is aborted and this method returns the value 2. Applications should pass in 0 for abort to continue streaming. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: provider_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI Provider property.
		*m: provider_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the Provider property.
		*m: refusaltext_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI RefusalText property.
		*m: refusaltext_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the RefusalText property.
		*m: registerjstools		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Adds JavaScript tool functions to the AI. This function can be called multiple times to add tool functions from multiple JavaScript sources. The JavaScript is passed in sb.
		*m: registermanualtools		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Sets the tools JSON for AI requests. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: responsestatuscode_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI ResponseStatusCode property.
		*m: responsestatuscode_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the ResponseStatusCode property.
		*m: selectedconvo_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI SelectConvo property.
		*m: selectedconvo_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the SelectedConvo property.
		*m: setaskparams		&& Introduced in version 11.3.0. Sets additional Ask params such as temperature, effort, and max_output_tokens. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: setconnectionsettings		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. This method copies connection settings, including HTTP proxy, SOCKS proxy, network interface IP address, and other related settings from sock.
		*m: setoutputschema		&& Introduced in version 11.6.0. Requests schema-constrained JSON output (structured output) for subsequent calls to Ask. name is a short schema name (letters, digits, underscores, and hyphens) used as an identifier by some providers.
		*m: setproviderparams		&& Introduced in version 11.3.0. Sets additional provider params needed for some pre-defined providers. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: sleepms		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. This method is provided for convenience. It causes the calling thread to sleep for a number of milliseconds. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: streamingjstoolcall		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Makes a JS tool call to handle a js_function_call event within a streaming Ask response loop.
		*m: streamingjstoolcallasync		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Creates an asynchronous task to call the StreamingJsToolCall method with the arguments provided. Note: Async method event callbacks happen in the background thread. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*m: streaming_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI Streaming property.
		*m: streaming_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the Streaming property.
		*m: uncommonoptions_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI UncommonOptions property.
		*m: uncommonoptions_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the UncommonOptions property.
		*m: uploadfile		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Uploads a file and returns the file_id (or uri) that can be used to reference the pre-uploaded file using InputAddFileId before an Ask.
		*m: uploadfileasync		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Creates an asynchronous task to call the UploadFile method with the arguments provided. Note: Async method event callbacks happen in the background thread. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*m: uploadfilebd		&& Introduced in Version 11.4.0. Uploads the contents of bd and returns the file_id (or uri) that can be used to reference the pre-uploaded file using InputAddFileId before an Ask.
		*m: uploadfilebdasync		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Creates an asynchronous task to call the UploadFileBd method with the arguments provided. Note: Async method event callbacks happen in the background thread.
		*m: uploadfilesb		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Uploads the contents of sb and returns the file_id (or uri) that can be used to reference the pre-uploaded file using InputAddFileId before an Ask.
		*m: uploadfilesbasync		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Creates an asynchronous task to call the UploadFileSb method with the arguments provided. Note: Async method event callbacks happen in the background thread.
		*m: usemcp		&& Introduced in version 11.6.0. Registers the tools provided by the connected MCP (Model Context Protocol) server cMcp so the AI model can call them during a conversation. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: usemcpasync		&& Introduced in version 11.6.0. Creates an asynchronous task to call the UseMcp method with the arguments provided. Note: Async method event callbacks happen in the background thread. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*m: verboselogging_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI VerboseLogging property.
		*m: verboselogging_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the VerboseLogging property.
		*p: apikey		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. This is the API key used for authentication. Use your API key that matches your Provider .
		*p: apikeyheader		&& Introduced in version 11.3.0. For custom Provider's, use this field name for the API key in the HTTP header, but only if the API key is to be placed in a custom header field. The default value of this property is the empty string.
		*p: apispec		&& Introduced in version 11.3.0. Specifies the API specification to be used. Possible choices are ChatCompletions, Responses, Gemini, Anthropic. The default value is Responses because the default value of the Provider property is openai.
		*p: baseurl		&& Introduced in version 11.3.0. Specifies the provider's base URL. For example, http://localhost:11434/v1 or https://api.together.xyz/v1. The default value is https://api.openai.com/v1 because the default value of the Provider property is openai.
		*p: debuglogfilepath		&& If set to a file path, causes each Chilkat method or property call to automatically append it's LastErrorText to the specified log file.
		*p: enablesecrets		&& Introduced in version 11.5.0. If 1 a secret specifier of the format "!!part1|part2|.." can be provided instead of the actual value for the ApiKey property. The default value is 0.
		*p: fulltranscript		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. If the property is set to 1, the full data/URL is re-sent in subsequent interactions. If set to 0, only the image or file summary is sent thereafter.
		*p: hasfunctioncalls		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. 1 if the response output has function calls. Otherwise 0. This only applies to manual function tool calling, not automatic JS tool calls.
		*p: heartbeatms		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. The interval in milliseconds between each AbortCheck event callback, which enables an application to abort certain method calls before they complete. By default, HeartbeatMs is set to 0.
		*p: hostedconvo		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. This applies to providers like OpenAI that can maintain conversation state on the server. If set to 1, only the conversation ID is sent with each query.
		*p: idletimeoutms		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. The maximum amount of time to wait for additional incoming data when receiving a response. The default value is 90000 (90 seconds).
		*p: jstooltimeout		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. The maximum time in seconds allowed for an automatic JavaScript tool function. The default value is 60 seconds to allow for most use cases, but to prevent an tool call that never returns.
		*p: lastbinaryresult		&& This property is mainly used in SQL Server stored procedures to retrieve binary data from the last method call that returned binary data. It is only accessible if Chilkat.Global.KeepBinaryResult is set to 1.
		*p: lasterrorhtml		&& Provides HTML-formatted information about the last called method or property. If a method call fails or behaves unexpectedly, check this property for details. Note that information is available regardless of the method call's success.
		*p: lasterrortext		&& Provides plain text information about the last called method or property. If a method call fails or behaves unexpectedly, check this property for details. Note that information is available regardless of the method call's success.
		*p: lasterrorxml		&& Provides XML-formatted information about the last called method or property. If a method call fails or behaves unexpectedly, check this property for details. Note that information is available regardless of the method call's success.
		*p: lastmethodsuccess		&& Indicates the success or failure of the most recent method call: 1 means success, 0 means failure. This property remains unchanged by property setters or getters.
		*p: lastresponserefused		&& Introduced in version 11.6.0. Read-only. 1 if the model refused to produce the requested structured output during the most recent Ask. When a refusal occurs, GetOutputJson returns 0 and the provider's explanation is available in RefusalText.
		*p: laststringresult		&& In SQL Server stored procedures, this property holds the string return value of the most recent method call that returns a string. It is accessible only when Chilkat.Global.KeepStringResult is set to TRUE.
		*p: laststringresultlen		&& The length, in characters, of the string contained in the LastStringResult property.
		*p: model		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. The model to be used for AI conversations. For example, GPT-4o or GPT-5. The list of available models can be obtained by calling GetModels. The default value is the empty string. A model must always be specified.
		*p: provider		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. This is the AI provider. Possible values are: openai, google, claude, deepseek, perplexity, and xai. The default value is openai.
		*p: refusaltext		&& Introduced in version 11.6.0. Read-only. When LastResponseRefused is 1, this is the model's message explaining why it declined to produce the requested structured output. Otherwise it is the empty string.
		*p: responsestatuscode		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. The HTTP response status code for the last Ask is as follows: 0 indicates an error occurred before receiving an HTTP response. 200 indicates a successful response. A failed response has a status code of 400 or higher.
		*p: selectedconvo		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. The currently selected conversation can be set to your desired conversation name. Once set, all future queries will be part of that conversation, updating its state with each input and output.
		*p: streaming		&& ntroduced in version 11.2.0. When set to 1, the Ask method operates in streaming mode, returning immediately after the request is sent. By default, this property is 0.
		*p: uncommonoptions		&& Introduced in version 11.2.0. This is a catch-all property to be used for uncommon needs. This property defaults to the empty string, and should typically remain empty.
		*p: verboselogging		&& If set to 1, then the contents of LastErrorText (or LastErrorXml, or LastErrorHtml) may contain more verbose information. The default value is 0.
	*</DefinedPropArrayMethod>

