	HIDDEN PROCEDURE idletimeoutms_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AI IdleTimeoutMs property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            IdleTimeoutMs_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat AI IdleTimeoutMs property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.IdleTimeoutMs
		* Date Added:        11/03/2025
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 11.2.0
		**
		** The maximum amount of time to wait for additional incoming data when receiving a response. 
		** The default value is 90000 (90 seconds) in v11.3.0 and earlier. 
		**
		** Starting in v11.4.0, the default value is 180000 (180 seconds). 
		**
		** This is not a total timeout, but the maximum time allowed when data transmission has paused.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 11
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 2
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 0
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [Long]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE idletimeoutms_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the IdleTimeoutMs property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            IdleTimeoutMs_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold 
