	PROCEDURE streamingjstoolcallasync		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Creates an asynchronous task to call the StreamingJsToolCall method with the arguments provided. Note: Async method event callbacks happen in the background thread. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            StreamingJsToolCallAsync
		* Purpose:           Creates an asynchronous task to call the StreamingJsToolCall
		*                    method with the arguments provided. 
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        toChilkatStringBuilder, a Chilkat StringBuilder object.
		* Returns:           toChilkatTask, a Chilkat Task object.
		* Date Added:        04/01/2026
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 11.4.0.
		**
		** Creates an asynchronous task to call the StreamingJsToolCall method with the arguments provided. 
		** (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
