	PROCEDURE deleteelementattr		&& Remove an attribute from an element.The index should be 0 unless there are multiple elements having the same tag, in which case it selects the Nth occurrence based on the index ( 0 = first occurrence ).
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            DeleteElementAttr
		* Purpose:           Removes the Nth occurrence of a given element from the Atom document.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tcTag -- the tag name to reference.
		*                    tiIndex -- the index value of the tag to reference.
		*                    tcAttribute -- the attribute to delete.
		* Returns:           
		* Date Added:        07/30/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Removes the Nth occurrence of a given element from the Atom document. 
		** Indexing begins at 0. For example, to remove the 2nd category, 
		** set tag = "category" and index = 1.
		**
		
		LPARAMETERS tcTag AS Character, tiIndex AS Integer, tcAttribute AS Character
		
