	HIDDEN PROCEDURE region_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AuthAWS Region property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            Region_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve the 
		*                    Chilkat AuthAWS Region property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.Region
		* Date Added:        07/30/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.58
		**
		** The AWS region, such as "us-east-1", "us-west-2", "eu-west-1", "eu-central-1", etc. 
		** The default is "us-east-1". It is only used when the SignatureVersion property 
		** is set to 4. This property is unused when the SignatureVersion property is set to 2.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
