	HIDDEN PROCEDURE signatureversion_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AuthAWS SignatureVersion property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            SignatureVersion_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
