	PROCEDURE obtainaccesstokenasync		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.58. Creates an asynchronous task to call the ObtainAccessToken method with the arguments provided. (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ObtainAccessTokenAsync
		* Purpose:           Creates an asynchronous task to call the 
		*                    ObtainAccessToken method with the arguments provided.
