	PROCEDURE generatetoken		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.65. Generates and returns the SAS token based on the defined StringToSign and params. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            GenerateToken
		* Purpose:           Generates and returns the SAS token 
		*                    based on the defined StringToSign and params.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
