	PROCEDURE taskcompleted		&& Called in the background thread when an asynchronous task completes.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            TaskCompleted
		* Purpose:           Called in the background thread when an asynchronous task completes.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        toTask, a Chilkat Task object.
		* Returns:           
		* Date Added:        10/20/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		LPARAMETERS toTask AS CHILKAT_TASK_COM_CALL
		
		LOCAL loTask AS CHILKAT_TASK_COM_CALL, llReturn AS Logical
		
		loTask = m.toTask
		llReturn = .F.
		
		*!*  ? [TaskCompleted Event!]
		
		WITH THIS
		
		  llReturn = .TaskCompleted_Pre(m.loTask)
		
		  ** Okay to continue test
		  IF m.llReturn
		
		    llReturn = .TaskCompleted_Process(m.loTask)
		
		  ENDIF m.llReturn
		  ** End okay to continue test
		
		  ** Okay to continue test
		  IF m.llReturn
		
		    llReturn = .TaskCompleted_Post(m.loTask)
		
		  ENDIF m.llReturn
		  ** End okay to continue test
		
		ENDWITH
		
		toTask = m.loTask
		
		RETURN
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE taskcompleted_post		&& Template TaskCompleted post-processing method.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            TaskCompleted_Post
		* Purpose:           Template TaskCompleted post-processing method. 
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
