	PROCEDURE isvalidutf8		&& Introduced in version 10.1.0. Returns 1 if this object contains valid utf-8 byte sequences. Any invalid byte sequence that is not valid utf-8 will cause this function to return 0. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            IsValidUTF8
		* Purpose:           Returns 1 if this object contains valid utf-8 byte sequences.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
