	PROCEDURE compressfiletomem		&& BZip2 compresses a file to an in-memory image of a .bz2 file. Returns a zero-length byte array (as a Variant) on failure. An empty array will have a UBound of -1 meaning 0 elements.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            CompressFileToMem
		* Purpose:           BZip2 compresses a file to an in-memory image of a .bz2 file.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tcFilePath, the path to the file to compress.
		* Returns:           Bz2 file data
		* Date Added:        07/29/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** BZip2 compresses a file to an in-memory image of a .bz2 file.
		** 
		** Returns a zero-length byte array (as a Variant) on failure.
		** 
		** An empty array will have a UBound of -1 meaning 0 elements.
		**
		
