	PROCEDURE loadbysubjectoid		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.85. Searches the Windows Local Machine and Current User registry-based certificate stores for a certificate containing a subject part matching the oid and value.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            LoadBySubjectOID
		* Purpose:           Searches the Windows Local Machine and Current User registry-based certificate 
		*                    stores for a certificate containing a subject part matching the oid and value.
