	HIDDEN PROCEDURE rfc822name_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Cert RFC822Name property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            RFC822Name_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the RFC822Name property of the referenced Chilkat object.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.RFC822Name
		* Date Added:        07/28/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** The RFC822 name of the certificate. (The RFC822 name is one part 
		** of the Subject Alternative Name extension of a certificate, if it exists. 
		** It is often the only part of the SAN.)
		** 
		** If the certificate contains a list of RFC822 names then this property 
		** will return the comma separated list of names.
		** 
		** Fix in version 85: The Rfc822Name property is changed to contain 
		** just the RFC822 name part of the cert’s SubjectAlternativeName.
		** If the full SubjectAlternativeName is needed, use the SubjectAlternativeName 
		** property to access the information as XML where the sub-parts can be extracted.  
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
