	HIDDEN PROCEDURE subjectalternativename_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Cert SubjectAlternativeName property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            SubjectAlternativeName_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the SubjectAlternativeName property of the referenced Chilkat object.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.SubjectAlternativeName
		* Date Added:        07/28/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.85
		**
		** The subject alternative name (SAN) name of the certificate returned as XML.
		** 
		** Fix in version 85: The Rfc822Name property is changed to contain 
		** just the RFC822 name part of the cert’s SubjectAlternativeName.
		** If the full SubjectAlternativeName is needed, use the SubjectAlternativeName 
		** property to access the information as XML where the sub-parts can be extracted.  
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [StringReadOnly]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 85
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

