	HIDDEN PROCEDURE reachesroot_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat CertChain ReachesRoot property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ReachesRoot_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat CertChain ReachesRoot property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
