	PROCEDURE findcertbysubjecte		&& Finds a certificate where the SubjectE property (email address) matches exactly (but case insensitive) with the passed string.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            FindCertBySubjectE
		* Purpose:           Finds a certificate where one of the SubjectE properties 
		*                    matches exactly (but case insensitive) with the passed string.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tcString, the string to search.
