		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** (This method only available on Microsoft Windows operating systems.)
		** Finds a certificate that can be used to send secure email 
		** to the passed email address. A certificate matches 
		** only if the ForSecureEmail property is TRUE, 
		** and the email address matches exactly (but case insensitive) 
		** with the SubjectE property. Returns NULL if no matches are found.
		**
		** Fixed in Version 69: Fixed an issue with automatically locating 
		** pre-installed Windows certificates (for encryption) 
		** when the email address stored within the certificate used uppercase letters.
		**
		** Note: Decremented in version 10.1.2 and will be removed in a future release.
		** Use FindCert instead.
		** 
		** Returns Nothing on failure.
		**
		
		LPARAMETERS tcEmailAddress AS Character
		
		LOCAL loChilkatObject AS CHILKAT_CERTSTORE_COM_CALL, ;
