	PROCEDURE openregistrystore		&& (This method only available on Microsoft Windows operating systems.) Opens an arbitrary registry-based certificate store. regRoot must be "CurrentUser" or "LocalMachine". regPath is a registry path such as "Software/MyApplication/Certificates".
