		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Converts a file from one character encoding to another. 
		** The FromCharset and ToCharset properties specify the source 
		** and destination character encodings. No preamble (also known as BOM) 
		** is included in the output.
		** 
		
		LPARAMETERS tcSourceFilePath AS Character, tcDestinationFilePath AS Character
		
		LOCAL loChilkatObject AS CHILKAT_CHARSET_COM_CALL, ;
		loException AS Exception, liReturn AS Integer, luReturn AS Unknown
		
