		** End design time IntelliSense test
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE convertfromutf16		&& Converts utf-16 text to the charset specified by the ToCharset property. Returns a zero-length byte array (as a Variant) on failure. An empty array will have a UBound of -1 meaning 0 elements.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ConvertFromUTF16
		* Purpose:           Converts utf-16 text to the charset specified by the ToCharset property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tqUTF16DataIn, the UTF-16 byte data to convert.
		* Returns:           Converted utf-16 byte data.
		* Date Added:        07/26/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Converts utf-16 text to the charset specified by the ToCharset property.
		** 
		** Returns a zero-length byte array (as a Variant) on failure.
		** 
		** An empty array will have a UBound of -1 meaning 0 elements.
		**
		
		LPARAMETERS tqUTF16DataIn AS VarBinary
		
		LOCAL loChilkatObject AS CHILKAT_CHARSET_COM_CALL, ;
		loException AS Exception, lqDataOut AS VarBinary
		
