		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Converts HTML text from one character encoding to another. 
		** The FromCharset and ToCharset properties must be set prior to calling this method. 
		** This method automatically edits the META tag within the HTML that indicates the charset.
		** 
		** Returns a zero-length byte array (as a Variant) on failure.
