	HIDDEN PROCEDURE laststringresultlen_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat CodeSign LastStringResultLen property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            LastStringResultLen_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the LastStringResultLen property of the referenced Chilkat object.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.LastStringResultLen
		* Date Added:        02/01/2024
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.97
		**
		** The length, in characters, of the string contained in the LastStringResult property.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
