		  loException = NEWOBJECT([Exception])
		
		#ENDIF .F.
		** End design time IntelliSense test
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE byteswap4321		&& Convenience method for byte swapping between little-endian byte ordering and big-endian byte ordering. Returns a zero-length byte array (as a Variant) on failure. An empty array will have a UBound of -1 meaning 0 elements.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ByteSwap4321
		* Purpose:           Utility method to convert bytes to a string. 
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
