	PROCEDURE getencodedsalt		&& Returns the password-based encryption (PBE) salt bytes as an encoded string. The encoding argument can be set to any of the following strings: "base64", "hex", "quoted-printable", or "url". Returns Nothing on failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            GetEncodedSalt
