	PROCEDURE hassignaturesigningtime		&& This method can be called after a digital signature has been verified by one of the Verify* methods.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            HasSignatureSigningTime
		* Purpose:           Returns 1 if a signing time for the Nth certificate 
		*                    is available and can be retrieved.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
