	HIDDEN PROCEDURE oaeppadding_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Crypt2 OAEPPadding property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            OAEPPadding_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat Crypt2 OAEPPadding property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
