	PROCEDURE opaquesignstringenc		&& Digitally signs a string and returns a PKCS7/CMS format signature in encoded string format (such as base64 or hex). This is a signature that contains both the original data as well as the signature.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            OpaqueSignStringENC
