		** Accessing and updating UI elements existing in the main thread may require special considerations.
		**
		** Returns Nothing on failure
		**
		
		LPARAMETERS toChilkatBinData AS CHILKAT_BINDATA_COM_CALL
		
		LOCAL loChilkatObject AS CHILKAT_CRYPT2_COM_CALL, loException AS Exception, ;
		loChilkatTask AS CHILKAT_TASK_COM_CALL, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer, ;
		loParkParameterBinData AS [iParkParameter OF ChilkatVFP.VCX], ;
		loChilkatBinData AS CHILKAT_BINDATA_COM_CALL, llImplemented AS Logical
		
