	PROCEDURE verifybytes		&& Verifies a byte array against a digital signature and returns true if the byte array is unaltered. Note: The signer certificates can be retrieved after any Verify* method call by using the NumSignerCerts property and the GetSignerCert method.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            VerifyBytes
