	HIDDEN PROCEDURE delimiter_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat CSV Delimiter property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            Delimiter_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat CSV Delimiter property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.Delimiter
		* Date Added:        05/25/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** The character that separates fields in a record. It is a comma by default. 
		** If the Delimiter property is not explicitly set, 
		** the CSV component will detect the delimiter when loading a CSV. 
		** (Semicolons are typically used in locales where the comma is used as a decimal point.)
		**
		** Note: If the default comma delimiter is not desired when creating a new CSV, 
		** make sure to set this property before adding rows/columns to the CSV.
		**
		** Fix for version 89: When the Delimiter property is updated, the old delimiter
		** will be replaced with the new delimiter in all rows of the CSV.
		** The provides the ability to convert a CSV to use a different delimiter, 
		** such as converting from comma to semicolon.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [String]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE delimiter_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the Delimiter property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            Delimiter_Assign
