		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Returns the contents of the cell at row, col. Indexing begins at 0. 
		** (The topmost/leftmost cell is at 0,0)
		** 
		** Returns Nothing on failure
		**
		
		LPARAMETERS tiRow AS Integer, tiColumn AS Integer
		
		LOCAL loChilkatObject AS CHILKAT_CSV_COM_CALL, ;
