	HIDDEN PROCEDURE dkimcanon_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat DKIM DKIMCanon property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            DKIMCanon_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat DKIM DKIMCanon property.
