	PROCEDURE setdkimprivatekey		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.71. Sets the private key file to be used for creating a DKIM-Signature. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            SetDKIMPrivateKey
		* Purpose:           Sets the private key file to be used for creating a DKIM-Signature.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
