	PROCEDURE fromencryptedpem		&& Loads a DSA private key from an in-memory encrypted PEM-formatted string. If the PEM passed to this method is unencrypted, the password is ignored and the PEM is simply loaded. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*==============================================================================
