	PROCEDURE getencodedsignature		&& Returns the bytes of the Signature property as a hex or base64 encoded string. The encoding should be set to either "hex" or "base64". The Signature property is set when SignHash is called. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            GetEncodedSignature
		* Purpose:           Returns the bytes of the Signature property as a hex or base64 encoded string.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
