	HIDDEN PROCEDURE hexg_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat DSA HexG property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            HexG_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the HexG property of the referenced Chilkat object.
