	PROCEDURE bencodestring		&& Takes a Unicode string, converts it to the charset specified in the 2nd parameter, B-Encodes the converted multibyte data, and returns the encoded Unicode string. Returns Nothing on failure
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            BEncodeString
		* Purpose:           Encodes a Unicode string.
