	PROCEDURE dropsingleattachment		&& Drops a single attachment from the email. Returns True if successful. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            DropSingleAttachment
		* Purpose:           Drops a single attachment from the email. Returns True if successful.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tiIndex, the related item index value.
		* Returns:           Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		* Date Added:        01/25/2022
