	HIDDEN PROCEDURE numdaysold_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Email NumDaysOld property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            NumDaysOld_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Email NumDaysOld property.
