	HIDDEN PROCEDURE numreports_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Email NumReports property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            NumReports_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Email NumReports property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.NumReports
		* Date Added:        01/21/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** (For multipart/report emails that have sub-parts with Content-Types such as message/feedback-report.) 
		** Any MIME sub-part within the email that has a Content-Type of "message/*", 
		** but is not a "message/rfc822", is considered to be a "report" and is included in this count. 
		** (A "message/rfc822" is considered an attached message 
		** and is handled by the NumAttachedMessages property and the GetAttachedMessage method.) 
		** Any MIME sub-part having a Content-Type equal to "text/rfc822-headers" 
		** is also considered to be a "report". 
		** The GetReport method may be called to get the body content of each 
		** "report" contained within a multipart/report email.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongReadOnly]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

