	HIDDEN PROCEDURE size_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Email Size property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            Size_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Email Size property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.Size
		* Date Added:        01/24/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** The size in bytes of the email, including all parts and attachments.
		**
		** Note: This property is only valid if the full email was downloaded. 
		** If only the header was downloaded, then this property will contain the size of just the header.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
