		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Returns a StringArray object containing UIDLs 
		** for all Email objects in the bundle. UIDLs are only valid for emails 
		** retrieved from POP3 servers. An email on a POP3 server has a "UIDL", 
		** an email on IMAP servers has a "UID". If the email was retrieved 
		** from an IMAP server, the UID will be accessible via the "ckx-imap-uid" header field.
		**
		** Update to Version 11.0.0: Method decremented.
