	PROCEDURE getlastmodified		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.66. Gets the last-modified date/time for a file. The accuracy of the last-modified data is to the number of seconds. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            GetLastModified
		* Purpose:           Gets the last-modified date/time for a file.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
