		*m: isconnected_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat IsConnected property.
		*m: isconnected_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the IsConnected property.
		*m: isunlocked		&& Undocumented method! Returns true if the class has been unlocked. It is necessary to call UnlockComponent before calling any other methods. Passing any string to UnlockComponent will automatically activate a 30-day trial period.
		*m: keepsessionlog_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat KeepSessionLog property.
		*m: keepsessionlog_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the KeepSessionLog property.
		*m: largefilemeasures_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat LargeFileMeasures property.
		*m: largefilemeasures_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LargeFileMeasures property.
		*m: largefileupload		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.58. This is the same as PutFile, but designed to work around the following potential problem associated with an upload that is extremely large.
		*m: largefileuploadasync		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.58. Creates an asynchronous task to call the LargeFileUpload method with the arguments provided. (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
		*m: lastbinaryresult_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat LastBinaryResult property.
		*m: lastbinaryresult_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastBinaryResult property.
		*m: lasterrorhtml_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat FTP2 LastErrorHTML property.
		*m: lasterrorhtml_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastErrorHTML property.
		*m: lasterrortext_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat FTP2 LastErrorText property.
		*m: lasterrortext_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastErrorText property.
		*m: lasterrorxml_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat FTP2 LastErrorXML property.
		*m: lasterrorxml_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastErrorXML property.
