		*m: partialtransfer_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the PartialTransfer property.
		*m: passiveusehostaddr_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat PassiveUseHostAddr property.
		*m: passiveusehostaddr_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the PassiveUseHostAddr property.
		*m: passive_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Passive property.
		*m: passive_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the Passive property.
		*m: password_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Password property.
		*m: password_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the Password property.
		*m: percentdonescale_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat PercentDoneScale property.
