	HIDDEN PROCEDURE allowmlsd_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat AllowMSLD property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            AllowMLSD_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat FTP2 AllowMLSD property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.AllowMLSD
		* Date Added:        02/23/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.50
		**
		** If 1, then uses the MLSD command to fetch directory listings when the FTP server supports MLSD. 
		** This property is 1 by default.
		**
		** When MLSD is used, the GetPermissions method will return the "perm fact" for a given file or directory. 
		** This is a different format than the more commonly recognized UNIX permissions string. 
		** Note: MLSD provides more accurate and dependable file listings, 
		** especially for last-mod date/time information. 
		** If usage of the MLSD command is turned off, 
		** it may adversely affect the quality and availability of other information.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongBit]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 50
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

