	PROCEDURE determinesettings		&& Discovers which combinations of FTP2 property settings result in successful data transfers.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            DetermineSettings
		* Purpose:           Discovers which combinations of FTP2 property settings 
		*                    result in successful data transfers.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
