	PROCEDURE getpermtype		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.50. Returns the type of permissions information that is available for the Nth file.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            GetPermType
		* Purpose:           Returns the type of permissions information that is available for the Nth file. 
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tiIndex, index to the file array.  
