	PROCEDURE getsslservercert		&& Returns the FTP server's digital certificate (for SSL / TLS connections). Returns Nothing on failure
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            GetSSLServerCert
		* Purpose:           Returns the FTP server's digital certificate (for SSL / TLS connections).
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
