	HIDDEN PROCEDURE largefilemeasures_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat LargeFileMeasures property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            LargeFileMeasures_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat FTP2 LargeFileMeasures property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.LargeFileMeasures
		* Date Added:        02/25/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.66
		**
		** Enables internal features that can help when uploading or downloading extremely large files. 
		** In some cases, if the time required to transfer a file is long, 
		** the control connection is closed by the server 
		** or other network infrastructure because it was idle for so long. 
		** Setting this property equal to 1 will keep the control connection
		** very slightly used to prevent this from happening.
		**
		** Enhancements for version 70:  This property now applies to uploads. 
		** (It originally applied only to FTP downloads.)
		**
		** The default value of this property is 0. 
		** This property should only be set to 1 if this sort of problem is encountered.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongBit]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 66
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE largefilemeasures_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LargeFileMeasures property.
		*==============================================================================
