	HIDDEN PROCEDURE listoption_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat ListOption property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ListOption_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the ListOption property of the referenced Chilkat object.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.ListOption
		* Date Added:        06/07/2026
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 11.4.0
		**
		** This property can be set to an option string, such as -a, 
		** which is added to the LIST command when retrieving FTP directory listings. 
		** This only applies when Chilkat issues the LIST command, 
		** as it prefers the MLSD command for servers that support it. 
		** Most servers do support MLSD, which provides machine-readable listings 
		** in a standardized format for easier parsing. 
		** Chilkat uses LIST only when necessary. 
		** Note that LIST options like LIST -a aren't part of the FTP standard; 
		** the listing format is unspecified in the FTP specification. 
		** Many servers merely pass these arguments to the underlying OS command, 
		** commonly ls on Unix systems.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [String]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 11
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 4
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 0
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE listoption_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the ListOption property.
