		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Contains the session log if KeepSessionLog is turned on.
		**
		** Fixed for Version 33: If the KeepSessionLog property was turned on, 
		** the password used for authentication was logged to the in-memory SessionLog property. 
		** The fix is to instead log “****” in place of the password.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
