	PROCEDURE setoldestdate		&& Undocumented method! See SetOldestDateStr method. It is assumed that this parameter is in a DateTime format.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            SetOldestDate
		* Purpose:           Call this method prior to calling DownloadTree 
		*                    to set the oldest date for a file to be downloaded.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        ttOldest -- the oldest date/time for a file to be downloaded.
		* Returns:           Chilkat Date/Time Object, or NULL
		* Date Added:        05/27/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Undocumented method! See SetOldestDateStr method. 
		** It is assumed that this parameter is in a DateTime format.
		**
		
		LPARAMETERS ttOldest AS DateTime
		
		LOCAL loChilkatObject AS CHILKAT_FTP2_COM_CALL, loException AS Exception
		
		STORE NULL TO m.loChilkatObject, m.loException
		
		WITH THIS
		
		  loChilkatObject = .oChilkat
		
		  ** Have a good object test
		  IF VARTYPE(m.loChilkatObject) == T_OBJECT ;
		  AND (NOT ISNULL(m.loChilkatObject))
		
		    ** PEM not removed from class test
		    IF NOT .IsPEMRemoved(11, 0, 0)
		
		      TRY
		
		        m.loChilkatObject.SetOldestDate(m.ttOldest)
		
		      CATCH TO m.loException
		
