		* Date Added:        02/24/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Read-only property that returns 1 if the FTP server's 
		** digital certificate was verified when connecting via SSL / TLS.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
