	PROCEDURE beginuploadfile		&& Called just prior to uploading a file. The file can be skipped by setting the skip output-only argument equal to 1.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            BeginUploadFile
		* Purpose:           Called just prior to uploading a file. 
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tcPath, the path to the file.
		*                    tiSkip, the skip setting.
