		liSkip = m.tiSkip
		
		*!*  ? [BeginUploadFile Event!]
		*!*  ? [BeginUploadFile: Path = ] + lcPath + [, Skip = ] + STR(liSkip)
		
		WITH THIS
		
		  ** OK to continue test
		  IF m.liSkip = 0
		
