		** Compresses a file to create a GZip compressed file (.gz). 
		** inFilename is the actual filename on disk. 
		** embeddedFilename is the filename to be embedded in the .gz such that 
		** when it is un-gzipped, this is the name of the file that will be created.
		** 
		** Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
