	HIDDEN PROCEDURE compressionlevel_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat GZip CompressionLevel property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            CompressionLevel_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat GZip CompressionLevel property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.CompressionLevel
		* Date Added:        05/05/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.50
		**
		** The compression level to be used when compressing. 
		** The default is 6, which is the typical value used 
		** for zip utility programs when compressing data. 
		** The compression level may range from 0 (no compression) to 9 (the most compression). 
		** The benefits of trying to increase compression 
		** may not be worth the added expense in compression time. 
		** In many cases (which is data dependent), the improvement in compression is minimal 
		** while the increase in computation time is significant.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [Long]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 50
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE compressionlevel_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the CompressionLevel property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            CompressionLevel_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold a reference to the CompressionLevel property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tiValue, integer value 
		*                    used to hold a reference to the CompressionLevel property.
		* Returns:           
		* Date Added:        05/05/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		LPARAMETERS tiValue AS Integer
		
		LOCAL lcValidationMethod AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 50
		
		lcValidationMethod = [CompressionLevel]
		lcMethodToCall = [Long]
		
		THIS.CallAssignObject(m.tiValue, m.lcMethodToCall, m.lcValidationMethod, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE compressmemory		&& Compresses in-memory data to an in-memory image of a .gz file. Note: There is a 4GB uncompressed size limitation. The uncompressed size of the file cannot be more than 4GB. Chilkat will be working to alleviate this limitation in the future.
