	PROCEDURE uncompressfiletomem		&& Un-Gzips a .gz file directly to memory. Note: There is a 4GB uncompressed size limitation. The uncompressed size of the file cannot be more than 4GB. Chilkat will be working to alleviate this limitation in the future.
		*==============================================================================
