		** The uncompressed size of the file cannot be more than 4GB. 
		** Chilkat will be working to alleviate this limitation in the future.
		** 
		** Returns a zero-length byte array (as a Variant) on failure.
		** 
		** An empty array will have a UBound of -1 meaning 0 elements.
		
