		** End design time IntelliSense test
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE xfdltoxml		&& Converts base64-gzip .xfdl data to a decompressed XML string. The xfldData contains the base64 data. This method returns the decoded/decompressed XML string. Returns Nothing on failure
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            XFDLToXML
		* Purpose:           Converts base64-gzip .xfdl data to a decompressed XML string.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
