		*m: createtimestamprequest		&& Creates an RFC 3161 time-stamp request and returns the binary request token in timestampToken. The hashAlg can be "sha1", "sha256", "sha384", "sha512", or "md5", The hashVal is the base64 hash of the data to be timestamped.
