		*m: digestauth_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the DigestAuth property.
		*m: dnscacheclear		&& Clears the Chilkat-wide in-memory hostname-to-IP address DNS cache. Chilkat automatically maintains this in-memory cache to prevent redundant DNS lookups.
		*m: download		&& Retrieves the content at a URL and saves to a file. All content is saved in streaming mode such that the memory footprint is small and steady. HTTPS is fully supported, as it is with all the methods of this class. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: downloadappend		&& Same as the Download method, but the output file is open for append. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: downloadappendasync		&& Creates an asynchronous task to call the DownloadAppend method with the arguments provided. (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
		*m: downloadasync		&& Creates an asynchronous task to call the Download method with the arguments provided. (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
		*m: downloadbd		&& Downloads the content at the url into a BinData object. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: downloadbdasync		&& Creates an asynchronous task to call the DownloadBd method with the arguments provided. (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
		*m: downloadhash		&& Retrieves the content at a URL and computes and returns a hash of the content.
		*m: downloadhashasync		&& Creates an asynchronous task to call the DownloadHash method with the arguments provided. (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
		*m: downloadsb		&& Downloads the content at the url into a Chilkat StringBuilder object. The charset tells Chilkat how to interpret the bytes received. The sb is appended with the downloaded text data. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*m: downloadsbasync		&& Creates an asynchronous task to call the DownloadSb method with the arguments provided. (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
