		*m: eventlogname		&& Undocumented method! Returns the name of the Nth event in the in-memory event log. Refer to the documentation for the KeepEventLog property for the full list of event names. Indexing is from 0 to EventLogCount-1.
		*m: eventlogvalue		&& Undocumented method! Returns the value of the Nth event in the in-memory event log. Indexing is from 0 to EventLogCount-1.
