		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** The regional endpoint (domain) to be used for Amazon S3 method calls. 
		** The default value is "s3.amazonaws.com". 
		** This can be set to any valid Amazon S3 endpoint, 
		** such as "s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com", 
		** or the endpoints for S3-API compatible services from other different providers.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
