	HIDDEN PROCEDURE freshnessalgorithm_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat HTTP FreshnessAlgorithm property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            FreshnessAlgorithm_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat HTTP FreshnessAlgorithm property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.FreshnessAlgorithm
		* Date Added:        01/27/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** The freshness algorithm to use when determining the freshness of a cached HTTP GET response. 
		** A value of 1 causes an LM-factor algorithm to be used. This is the default. 
		** The LMFactor property is a value between 1 and 100 indicating the percentage 
		** of time based on the last-modified date of the HTML page. 
		** For example, if the LMFactor is 50, and an HTML page was modified 10 days ago, 
		** then the page will expire (i.e. no longer be fresh) in 5 days (50% of 10 days). 
		** This only applies to HTTP responses that do not have page expiration information. 
		** If the FreshnessAlgorithm = 0, then a constant expire time period determined 
		** by the DefaultFreshPeriod property is used.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongBit]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE freshnessalgorithm_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the FreshnessAlgorithm property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            FreshnessAlgorithm_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold a reference to the FreshnessAlgorithm property.
