	PROCEDURE geturlpath		&& Returns the path part of a URL. The syntax of a URL is <scheme>://<user>:<password>@<host>:<port>/<path>;<params>?<query>#<frag>. This method returns the "path" part. Returns Nothing on failure
		*==============================================================================
