	PROCEDURE g_svcoauthaccesstoken2		&& The same as the G_SvcOauthAccessToken method, but with added flexibility for more customization. The 1st three args of the G_SvcOauthAccessToken are replaced with claimParams allowing for future expansion of name-value params.
