	HIDDEN PROCEDURE mimicfirefox_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat HTTP MimicFireFox property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            MimicFireFox_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat HTTP MimicFireFox property.
