		*                    tuGZip, set to 1 if tqBinData is gZip compressed.
		* Returns:           Chilkat Task object, or NULL
		* Date Added:        02/01/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Creates an asynchronous task to call the PostBinary method with the arguments provided. 
		** (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
