		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Removes a header from the internal list of custom header 
		** field name/value pairs to be automatically added when 
		** HTTP requests are sent via methods that do not use the HTTP request object. 
		** (The SetRequestHeader method is called to add custom header fields.)
