	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE setdpopkey		&& Introduced in version 11.4.0. Sets the EC private key for automatically adding the DPoP header to HTTP requests. Chilkat will generate a JWT for each request and include the DPoP header. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*==============================================================================
