	HIDDEN PROCEDURE charset_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat HTTPResponse Charset property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            Charset_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat HTTPRequest Charset property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.Charset
		* Date Added:        06/02/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** The response charset, such as "iso-8859-1", if applicable. 
		** Obviously, responses for GIF and JPG files will not have a charset.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
