		** Design time IntelliSense test
		#IF .F.
		
		  loChilkatObject = NEWOBJECT(CHILKAT_HTTPRESPONSE_COM_CALL)
		  loException = NEWOBJECT([Exception])
		
		#ENDIF .F.
		** End design time IntelliSense test
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE getheaderfieldattr		&& Returns a response header field attribute. As an example, the response charset is simply the GetHeaderFieldAttr("content-type","charset"). Returns Nothing on failure
