	HIDDEN PROCEDURE authmethod_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat IMAP AuthMethod property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            AuthMethod_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat IMAP AuthMethod property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.AuthMethod
		* Date Added:        06/15/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Can be set to "XOAUTH2", "CRAM-MD5", "NTLM", "PLAIN", or "LOGIN" 
		** to select the authentication method. NTLM is the most secure, 
		** and is a synonym for "Windows Integrated Authentication". 
		** The default is "LOGIN" (or the empty string) which is simple plain-text 
		** username/password authentication. 
		** Not all IMAP servers support all authentication methods.
		**
		** The XOAUTH2 method was added in version 9.5.0.44.
		**
		** Note: If SPA (i.e. NTLM) authentication does not succeed, 
		** set the Global.DefaultNtlmVersion property equal to 1 and then retry.
		**
		** Enhancement for Version 49: This method may now be set to “NONE”. 
		** This was needed in one case where the authentication was implicit 
		** with the client-side SSL/TLS cert. 
		** If set to “NONE”, then the Login method call may be omitted.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [String]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE authmethod_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the AuthMethod property.
