	HIDDEN PROCEDURE autodownloadattachments_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat IMAP AutoDownloadAttachments property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            AutoDownloadAttachments_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat IMAP AutoDownloadAttachments property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.AutoDownloadAttachments
		* Date Added:        06/15/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** If set to 1, then all Fetch* methods will also automatically download attachments. 
		** If set to 0, then the Fetch* methods download the email without attachments. 
		** The default value is 1.
		** 
		** Note: Methods that download headers-only, such as FetchSingleHeader, 
		** ignore this property and never download attachments. 
		** Also, signed and/or encrypted emails will always be downloaded in full 
		** (with attachments) regardless of this property setting.
		**
		** Fix for Version 59: A particular kind of email on a particular IMAP server 
		** would cause a hang (or timeout) when downloading the email 
		** for the case where this property is disabled.
		**
		** Fix for Version 78: Fixed a problem parsing IMAP server responses 
		** when fetching emails with AutoDownloadAttachments=false 
		** where the email is empty without attachments.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongBit]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE autodownloadattachments_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the AutoDownloadAttachments property.
