		*                    SetFlag method with the arguments provided.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tiMessageID -- the message ID of the copied message.
		*                    tuUID -- whether or not the message ID is a UID.
		*                    tcFlagName -- the flag name to set the value against.
		*                    tuValue, whether or not it is set to on or off.
		* Returns:           Chilkat Task Object, or NULL
		* Date Added:        06/22/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Creates an asynchronous task to call the SetFlag method with the arguments provided. 
		** (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
		** Note: Async method event callbacks happen in the background thread. 
		** Accessing and updating UI elements existing in the main thread may require special considerations.
		**
		** Returns Nothing on failure
		** 
		
		
		LPARAMETERS tiMessageID AS Integer, tuUID AS Unknown, ;
