	PROCEDURE emit		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.58. Writes the JSON array (rooted at the caller) and returns as a string. Note: To control the compact/non-compact format, and to control the LF/CRLF line-endings, set the EmitCompact and EmitCrlf properties.
