	PROCEDURE appendbool		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.58. Appends a new boolean member. (This is the same as passing -1 to the AddBoolAt method.) Important: The name is the member name. It is not a JSON path. To append (or update) using a JSON path, call UpdateBool instead.
