	PROCEDURE emitwithsubs		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.67. Emits the JSON document with variable substitutions applied. If omitEmpty is 1, then members having empty strings or empty arrays are omitted. Returns Nothing on failure
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            EmitWithSubs
