	HIDDEN PROCEDURE lastmethodsuccess_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat JWS LastMethodSuccess property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            LastMethodSuccess_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the LastMethodSuccess property of the referenced Chilkat object.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.LastMethodSuccess
		* Date Added:        07/20/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.52
		** 
		** Indicate whether the last method call succeeded or failed. 
		** A value of 1 indicates success, a value of 0 indicates failure. 
		** This property is automatically set for method calls. 
		** It is not modified by property accesses. 
		** The property is automatically set to indicate success for 
		** the following types of method calls:
		**
		** Any method that returns a string.
		** Any method returning a Chilkat object, binary bytes, or a date/time.
		** Any method returning a standard boolean status value where success = 1 and failure = 0.
		** Any method returning an integer where failure is defined by a return value less than zero.
		** Note: Methods that do not fit the above requirements will 
		** always set this property equal to 1. 
		** For example, a method that returns no value (such as a "void" in C++) 
		** will technically always succeed.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongBit]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 66 && 52
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
		
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE lastmethodsuccess_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the LastMethodSuccess property.
