		* Date Added:        06/26/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.53
		**
		** The length, in characters, of the string contained in the LastStringResult property.
		**
		** Fixed for version 65: This property incorrectly returned the size of the string in bytes (utf-16) 
