	PROCEDURE fetchmultipleheaders		&& Given an array of UIDL strings, fetches all the email headers from the POP3 server whose UIDL is present in the array.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            FetchMultipleHeaders
		* Purpose:           Fetches all the email headers from the POP3 server 
		*                    whose UIDL is present in the array.
