		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.56
		**
		** Creates an asynchronous task to call the 
		** Pop3Authenticate method with the arguments provided. 
		** (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.)
		**
