	HIDDEN PROCEDURE pop3spa_access		&& Access method used to retrieve a reference to the POP3SPA property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            POP3SPA_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat MailMan POP3SPA property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
