	HIDDEN PROCEDURE poppasswordbase64_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the POPPasswordBase64 property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            POPPasswordBase64_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold
		*                    the Chilkat MailMan POPPasswordBase64 property.
