	HIDDEN PROCEDURE smtphost_access		&& Access method used to retrieve a reference to the SMTPHost property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            SMTPHost_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat MailMan SMTPHost property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
