	HIDDEN PROCEDURE smtppipelining_access		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.49. Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat MailMan SMTPPipelining property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            SMTPPipelining_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat MailMan SMTPPipelining property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
