		* Date Added:        01/13/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.49
		**
		** Controls whether SMTP pipelining is automatically 
		** used when the SMTP server indicates support for it. 
		** The default is 1. Setting this property equal to 0 
		** will prevent the SMTP pipelining feature from being used.
		**
		
