		**
		** Introduced in version 11.6.0
		** 
		** The maximum amount of time, in milliseconds, to wait to establish 
		** the TCP/TLS connection to the MCP server. The default value is 30000 (30 seconds).
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
