	HIDDEN PROCEDURE laststringresultlen_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat MessageSet LastStringResultLen property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            LastStringResultLen_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
