		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Some HTTP responses contain headers of various types 
		** that indicate that the page should not be cached. 
		** Chilkat MHT will adhere to this unless this property is set to 1.
		** 
		** The default value of this property is 0.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
