		* Date Added:        07/18/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Only applies when creating MHT files. Scripts are always removed 
		** when creating EML or emails from HTML. If set to 1, then all scripts are removed, 
		** if set to 0 (the default) then scripts are not removed.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
