		* Date Added:        06/25/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Converts existing MIME to a multipart/mixed. 
		** This is accomplished by creating a new outermost multipart/mixed MIME part. 
		** The existing MIME is moved into the 1st (and only) 
		** sub-part of the new multipart/mixed enclosure. 
