		** The value of the Content-Encoding header field, excluding any attributes. 
		** For example, if the Content-Encoding header is this:
		** 
		** Content-Encoding: attachment; filename="starfish.gif"
		** 
		** then the value of the Encoding property is "attachment".
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
