	HIDDEN PROCEDURE signinghashalg_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat MIME SigningHashAlg property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            SigningHashAlg_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat MIME SigningHashAlg property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.SigningHashAlg
		* Date Added:        06/25/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Selects the underlying hash algorithm used when sending signed (PKCS7) email. 
		** Possible values are "sha1", "sha256", "sha384", "sha512", "md5", and "md2".
		** 
		** Note: This property does not get set when a signature is verified. 
		** It is only used to specify the algorithm when creating a signature. 
		** The LastJsonData method can be used to get information about the verified signature(s).
		**
		** Change in version 11.0.0: Default changed to sha256.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [String]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

