	HIDDEN PROCEDURE ntlmversion_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat NTLM NTLMVersion property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            NTLMVersion_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat NTLM NTLMVersion property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.NTLMVersion
		* Date Added:        07/15/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** The version of the NTLM protocol to be used. Must be set to either 1 or 2. 
		** The default value is 1 (for NTLMv1). Setting this property equal to 2 selects NTLMv2.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
