	PROCEDURE parsetype1		&& For informational purposes only. Allows for the server-side to parse a Type 1 message to get human-readable information about the contents. Returns Nothing on failure
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ParseType1
		* Purpose:           Allows for the server-side to parse a Type 1 message 
		*                    to get human-readable information about the contents.
