	HIDDEN PROCEDURE basestring_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat OAuth1 BaseString property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            BaseString_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the BaseString property of the referenced Chilkat object.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
