		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.53
		**
		** The OAuth URL, such as "http://echo.lab.madgex.com/echo.ashx". 
		** See http://bettiolo.github.io/oauth-reference-page/ 
		** to compare Chilkat results with another tool's results.
		**
		** Note: The OAuthUrl should not include query parameters. 
		** For example, do not set the OAuthUrl equal to
		** 
		**   https://rest.sandbox.netsuite.com/app/site/hosting/restlet.nl?script=165&deploy=1
		**
		** Instead, set OAuthUrl equal to
		** 
		**   https://rest.sandbox.netsuite.com/app/site/hosting/restlet.nl
		**
		** and then subsequently call AddParam for each query parameter.
		**
		
