	HIDDEN PROCEDURE verboselogging_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat OAuth1 VerboseLogging property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            VerboseLogging_Access
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to retrieve 
		*                    the VerboseLogging property of the referenced Chilkat object.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
