	PROCEDURE cancel		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.59. Cancels an OAuth2 authorization flow that is in progress. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            Cancel
		* Purpose:           Adds an additional custom query param to the request 
		*                    that occurs to exchange the authorization code for a token.
