		* Date Added:        06/08/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.59
		** 
		** If the OAuth2 three-legged authorization failed prior to completion (the AuthFlowState = 5), 
		** then information about the failure is contained in this property. 
		** This property is automatically cleared when OAuth2 authorization starts 
		** (i.e. when StartAuth is called).
