	HIDDEN PROCEDURE redirectallowhtml_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat oAuth2 RedirectAllowHTML property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            RedirectAllowHTML_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat oAuth2 RedirectAllowHTML property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.RedirectAllowHTML
		* Date Added:        06/08/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.59
		**
		** This property contains the HTML returned to the browser when access is allowed by the end-user. 
		** The default value is HTML that contains a META refresh 
		** to https://www.chilkatsoft.com/oauth2_allowed.html. 
		** Your application should set this property to display whatever HTML 
		** is desired when access is granted.
		** 
		** The default value of this property is:
		** 
		** <html>
		**   <head><meta http-equiv='refresh' content='0;url=https://www.chilkatsoft.com/oauth2_allowed.html'></head>
		**   <body>Thank you for allowing access.</body>
		** </html>
		** You may wish to change the refresh URL to a web page on your company website. 
		** Alternatively, you can provide simple HTML that does not redirect anywhere 
		** but displays whatever information you desire.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [String]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 59
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
		
	ENDPROC

