	HIDDEN PROCEDURE uncommonoptions_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat OAuth2 UncommonOptions property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            UncommonOptions_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat OAuth2 UncommonOptions property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.UncommonOptions
		* Date Added:        12/23/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.85
		**
		** This is a catch-all property to be used for uncommon needs. 
		** This property defaults to the empty string and should typically remain empty.
		** 
		** Can be set to a list of the following comma separated keywords:
		** 
		** "NO_OAUTH2_SCOPE" - Do not includethe "scope" parameter 
		** when exchanging the authorization code for an access token.
		**
		** Added to version 98: Added the “ExchangeCodeForTokenUsingJson” UncommonOption keyword 
		** to allow apps to specify that a JSON POST should be used instead of the typical 
		** application/x-www-form-urlencoded request that finishes the OAuth2 authorization flow. 
		** Also added the “RefreshTokenUsingJson” to force the OAuth2 refresh to use a JSON POST if needed.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [String]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 85
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
		
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE uncommonoptions_assign		&& Assign method used to retrieve the Chilkat OAuth2 UncommonOptions property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            UncommonOptions_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold 
		*                    the Chilkat OAuth2 UncommonOptions property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
