	PROCEDURE loadfrombinary		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.58. Loads a public key from binary DER. Auto-recognizes both PKCS1 and PKCS8 formats. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            LoadFromBinary
		* Purpose:           Loads a public key from binary DER.
