		** For example, if name is "fileId" and value is "1R_70heIyzIAu1_u0prXbYcaIiJRVkgBl", 
		** then a uriPath argument of "/drive/v3/files/fileId" will be transformed 
		** to "/drive/v3/files/1R_70heIyzIAu1_u0prXbYcaIiJRVkgBl" in a method call.
