	PROCEDURE fullrequestbinary		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.58. Sends a complete REST request (header + body) and receives the full response. It is assumed that the request body is binary, and the response body is a string (such as JSON or XML).
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            FullRequestBinary
		* Purpose:           Sends a complete REST request and receives the full response.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tcHTTPVerb, the header name.
		*                    tcURLPath, the URL path within the domain.
