		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.62
		**
		** Sends a complete REST request (header + body string) and receives the full response. 
		** The body of the request is passed in requestBody. 
		** The response body is returned in responseBody 
		** (replacing whatever contents responseBody may have previously held).
