		** is composed of the URL encoded query params. 
		** The httpVerb is the HTTP verb (also known as the HTTP method), such as "POST". 
		** The uriPath is the path of the resource URI. If the Content-Type header was set, 
		** it is ignored and instead the Content-Type of the request will be 
		** "application/x-www-form-urlencoded".
