		#ENDIF .F.
		** End design time IntelliSense test
	ENDPROC

	PROCEDURE opensslverifystring		&& Duplicates OpenSSL's rsautl utility for verifying RSA signatures and recovering the original data. Input data consists of the raw signature bytes and returns the original string. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            OpenSSlVerifyString
		* Purpose:           Duplicates OpenSSL's rsautl utility for verifying RSA signatures 
		*                    and recovering the original data.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
