		**
		** Creates an RSA digital signature by hashing strToBeHashed and then signing the hash. 
		** The hash algorithm is specified by hashAlgorithm, which may be "SHA-1", "MD5", "MD2", 
		** "SHA-256", "SHA-384", or "SHA-512". The recommended hash algorithm is "SHA-1".
		** 
		** Important: If trying to match OpenSSL results, set the LittleEndian property = 0. 
		** (The LittleEndian property should also be set to 0 to match Amazon web services, such as CloudFront.)
