		* Date Added:        06/27/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Provides information in HTML format about the last method/property called. 
		** If a method call returns a value indicating failure, or behaves unexpectedly, 
		** examine this property to get more information.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
