	PROCEDURE checkstatus		&& Introduced in version 9.50.87. Check the current status of the currently connected reader. Calling this method updates the ReaderStatus, ActiveProtocol, and CardAtr properties.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            CheckStatus
