	PROCEDURE pinchange		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.87. Changes a PIN. The pinId can be "user", "admin", or "3" through "7". (It is typically "user".) The currentPin is the current alphanumeric PIN. The newPin is the new PIN. Returns 0 for success.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            PINChange
		* Purpose:           Changes a PIN.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
