	PROCEDURE updatesecretstr		&& Introduced in version 10.1.0. Creates a string secret if it does not yet exist, or updates an existing secret. The name of the secret is specified in jsonId, and the string content of the secret in secret. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
