	PROCEDURE authenticatesecpw		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.71. The same as AuthenticatePw, but the login and password are passed in secure string objects. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            AuthenticateSecPw
		* Purpose:           The same as AuthenticatePw, except the login 
		*                    and passwords strings are passed in secure string objects.
