	PROCEDURE getfilecreatetime		&& Undocumented method! See GetFileCreateTimeStr method. It is assumed that this method returns the value in a DateTime format.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            GetFileCreateTime
		* Purpose:           Undocumented method! See GetFileCreateTimeStr method.
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
