	PROCEDURE getfilepermissions		&& Returns the access permisssions flags of a file. pathOrHandle may be a remote filepath or an open handle string as returned by OpenFile. If pathOrHandle is a handle, then bIsHandle must be set to 1, otherwise it should be 0.
