	HIDDEN PROCEDURE isimmutable_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat SFtpFile IsImmutable property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            IsImmutable_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat SFTPFile IsImmutable property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.IsImmutable
		* Date Added:        06/08/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** The file cannot be deleted or renamed, no hard link can be created to this file, 
		** and no data can be written to the file.
		** 
		** This bit implies a stronger level of protection than ReadOnly, 
		** the file permission mask or ACLs. Typically even the superuser 
		** cannot write to immutable files, and only the superuser can set or remove the bit.
		** 
		** This property is only supported by servers running SFTP v6 or later.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongBitReadOnly]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

