	HIDDEN PROCEDURE issparse_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat SFtpFile IsSparse property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            IsSparse_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat SFTPFile IsSparse property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.IsSparse
		* Date Added:        06/08/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** The file is a sparse file; this means that file blocks 
		** that have not been explicitly written are not stored on disk. 
		** For example, if a client writes a buffer at 10 M from the beginning of the file, 
		** the blocks between the previous EOF marker and the 10 M offset 
		** would not consume physical disk space.
		** 
		** Some servers may store all files as sparse files, 
		** in which case this bit will be unconditionally set. 
		** Other servers may not have a mechanism for determining if the file is sparse, 
		** and so the file MAY be stored sparse even if this flag is not set.
		** 
		** This property is only supported by servers running SFTP v6 or later.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongBitReadOnly]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE issparse_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the IsSparse property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            IsSparse_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold 
		*                    the IsSparse property of the referenced Chilkat object.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tuValue, integer/logical value 
		*                    used to hold a reference to the IsSparse property.
		* Returns:           
		* Date Added:        06/08/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		LPARAMETERS tuValue AS Unknown
		
		LOCAL lcValidationMethod AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
