	HIDDEN PROCEDURE lastbinaryresult_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Socket LastBinaryResult property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            LastBinaryResult_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
