		**
		** The local IP address of the local computer. 
		** For multi-homed computers (i.e. computers with multiple IP adapters) 
		** this property returns the default IP address.
		** 
		** Note: This will be the internal IP address, not an external IP address. 
		** (For example, if your computer is on a LAN, it is likely to be an IP address 
		** beginning with "192.168.".
		** 
		** Important: Use LocalIpAddress and LocalIpPort to get the local IP/port 
		** for a bound or connected socket.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
