	HIDDEN PROCEDURE receivedcount_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Socket ReceivedCount property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ReceivedCount_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat Socket ReceivedCount property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.ReceivedCount
		* Date Added:        05/28/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Any method that receives data will increase the value of this property 
		** by the number of bytes received. The application may reset this property to 0 at any point. 
		** It is provided as a way to keep count of the total number of bytes received 
		** on a socket connection, regardless of which method calls are used to receive the data.
		** 
		** Note: The ReceivedCount may be larger than the number of bytes returned by some methods. 
		** For methods such as ReceiveUntilMatch, the excess received on the socket (beyond the match), 
		** is buffered by Chilkat for subsequent method calls. 
		** The ReceivedCount is updated based on the actual number of bytes received 
		** on the underlying socket in real-time. 
		** (The ReceivedCount does not include the overhead bytes associated 
		** with the TLS and/or SSH protocols.
		** 
		
		** Note: The documentation implies this is a user settable property.
		** Rudimentary testing and what's implied by the description indicate
		** that this is a read only property. 05/28/2022 WAA
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongReadOnly]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE receivedcount_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the ReceivedCount property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ReceivedCount_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold a reference to the ReceivedCount property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tiValue, integer value 
		*                    used to hold a reference to the ReceivedCount property.
		* Returns:           
		* Date Added:        05/28/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		LPARAMETERS tiValue AS Integer
		
		LOCAL lcValidationMethod AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		lcValidationMethod = []
		lcMethodToCall = [LongReadOnly]
		
		THIS.CallAssignObject(m.tiValue, m.lcMethodToCall, m.lcValidationMethod)
		
		RETURN
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE receivedint_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Socket ReceivedInt property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ReceivedInt_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat Socket ReceivedInt property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
