		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.50
		**
		** Contains the last integer received via a call to ReceiveByte, ReceiveInt16, or ReceiveInt32.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
