	PROCEDURE receiveint32		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.50. Receives a 32-bit integer (4 bytes). The received integer will be available in the ReceivedInt property. Set bigEndian equal to 1 if the incoming 32-bit integer is in big-endian byte order.
