	PROCEDURE receiveuntilbytebd		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.76. Receives bytes on the TCP/IP or SSL socket until a specific 1-byte value is read. Returns all the bytes up to and including the lookForByte. The received bytes are appended to bd.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ReceiveUntilByteBd
		* Purpose:           Receives bytes on the TCP/IP or SSL socket 
		*                    until a specific 1-byte value is read.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
