	PROCEDURE sendint16		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.50. Sends a 16-bit integer (2 bytes). Set bigEndian equal to 1 to send the integer in big-endian byte order (this is the standard network byte order). Otherwise set bigEndian equal to 0 to send in little-endian byte order.
