		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** The maximum HTTP response size allowed. 
		** The spider will automatically fail any pages larger than this size. 
		** The default value is 250,000 bytes.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
