	HIDDEN PROCEDURE winddowncount_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Spider WindDownCount property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            WindDownCount_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat Spider WindDownCount property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
