	HIDDEN PROCEDURE stripcolorcodes_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat SSH StripColorCodes property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            StripColorCodes_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat SSH StripColorCodes property.
