	HIDDEN PROCEDURE uncommonoptions_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat SSHTunnel UncommonOptions property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            UnCommonOptions_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat SSHTunnel UnCommonOptions property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.UnCommonOptions
		* Date Added:        07/07/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.73
		**
		** This is a catch-all property to be used for uncommon needs. 
		** This property defaults to the empty string, and should typically remain empty.
		** 
		** Can be set to a list of the following comma separated keywords:
		** 
		** "KEX_DH_GEX_REQUEST_OLD" - Introduced in v9.5.0.73. 
		** Force the old Group Exchange message to be used. 
		** This would be used for very old SSH server implementations that do not use 
		** the RFC standard for diffie-hellman-group-exchange.
		**
		** "NoKeepAliveIgnoreMsg" - (Added in v9.5.0.76) Prevents the default behavior 
		** of the SSH tunnel sending an "ignore" message every 20 seconds 
		** to keep an unused connection alive.
		**
		** "ProtectFromVpn" - Introduced in v9.5.0.80. On Android systems, will bypass 
		** any VPN that may be installed or active.
		**
		** "+chacha20-poly1305@openssh.com" - Introduced in 9.5.0.97. 
		** Readds this cipher to the list of cipher defaults. 
		**
		** “+ssh-hmac-etm”  - Introduced in 9.5.0.97. Adds three
		** MAC Algorithms (hmac-sha1-etm@openssh.com, hmac-sha2-256-etm@openssh.com 
		** hmac-sha2-512-etm@openssh.com) to the list of MAC Algorithm defaults. 
		** See the documentation for the Connect method. 
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [String]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 73
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE uncommonoptions_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the UncommonOptions property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            UnCommonOptions_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold
