	HIDDEN PROCEDURE defaultchunksize_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Stream DefaultChunkSize property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            DefaultChunkSize_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat Stream DefaultChunkSize property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.DefaultChunkSize
		* Date Added:        06/13/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.56
		**
		** The default internal chunk size for reading or writing. 
		** The default value is 65536. If this property is set to 0, 
		** it will cause the default chunk size (65536) to be used. 
		** Note: The chunk size can have significant performance impact. 
		** If performance is an issue, be sure to experiment with different chunk sizes.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
