	PROCEDURE readbdasync		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.67. Creates an asynchronous task to call the ReadBd method with the arguments provided. (Async methods are available starting in Chilkat v9.5.0.52.) Note: Async method event callbacks happen in the background thread.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            ReadBdAsync
		* Purpose:           Creates an asynchronous task to call the ReadBd 
		*                    method with the arguments provided.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        toChilkatBinData, a Chilkat Binary Data object.
