	HIDDEN PROCEDURE sourcefile_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Stream SourceFile property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            SourceFile_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat Stream SourceFile property.
