	PROCEDURE iswellformed		&& Introduced in version 11.6.0. Returns 1 if the contents of this object are well-formed JSON or XML. format selects which check to apply and must be json or xml (case insensitive). Returns 0 if the contents do not conform, or if format is anything else.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            IsWellFormed
