	HIDDEN PROCEDURE length_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the Length property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            Length_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold a reference to the Length property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tiValue, integer value 
