	PROCEDURE triminsidespaces		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.62. Replaces all tabs, CR's, and LF's, with SPACE chars, and removes extra SPACE's so there are no occurances of more than one SPACE char in a row. Returns 1 for success, 0 for failure.
