	HIDDEN PROCEDURE laststringresultlen_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat StringTable LastStringResultLen property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            LastStringResultLen_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the LastStringResultLen property of the referenced Chilkat object.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
