	HIDDEN PROCEDURE mustmatch_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat TAR MustMatch property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            MustMatch_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat TAR MustMatch property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.MustMatch
		* Date Added:        05/07/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.46
		**
		** If set, then file paths must match this pattern when creating TAR archives, 
		** or when extracting from TAR archives. If a file does not match, 
		** it will not be included when creating a TAR, 
		** or it will not be extracted when extracting from a TAR. 
		** This property also applies to methods 
		** that create or extract from compressed TAR archives.
		**
		** The must-match pattern may include 0 or more asterisk characters, 
		** each of which represents 0 or more of any character. 
		** For example, the pattern "*.txt" causes only .txt files to be included or extracted. 
		** The default value is an empty string, 
		** indicating that all files are implicitly matched.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [String]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 46
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

