		**
		** The total number of directory roots set by calling AddDirRoot 
		** (i.e. the number of times AddDirRoot was called by the application). 
		** A TAR archive is created by calling AddDirRoot 
		** for one or more directory tree roots, followed by a single call 
		** to WriteTar (or WriteTarBz2, WriteTarGz, WriteTarZ). 
		** This allows for TAR archives containing multiple directory trees to be created.
