	PROCEDURE compressstring		&& Compresses a string to an in-memory image of a .Z file. Prior to compression, the string is converted to the character encoding specified by charset.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            CompressString
		* Purpose:           Compresses a string to an in-memory image of a .Z file.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tcString -- the string to compress.
