	PROCEDURE uncompressfiletostring		&& Uncompresses a .Z file that contains a text file. The contents of the text file are returned as a string. The character encoding of the text file is specified by charset.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            UncompressFileToString
		* Purpose:           Uncompresses a .Z file that contains a text file.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tcZFilePath -- the path to the .Z file containing a text file.
		*                    tcCharset -- the charset of the string.
		* Returns:           An in-memory image of a .Z file.
		* Date Added:        07/06/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Uncompresses a .Z file that contains a text file. 
		** The contents of the text file are returned as a string. 
		** The character encoding of the text file is specified by charset. 
		** Typical charsets are "iso-8859-1", "utf-8", "windows-1252", "shift_JIS", "big5", etc.
		** 
		** Returns Nothing on failure
		**
		
		LPARAMETERS tcZFilePath AS Character, tcCharset AS Character
		
		LOCAL loChilkatObject AS CHILKAT_UNIXCOMPRESS_COM_CALL, ;
