		*m: hostname_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the HostName property.
		*m: idletimeoutms_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Upload IdleTimeoutMs property.
		*m: idletimeoutms_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the IdleTimeoutMs property.
		*m: lastbinaryresult_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Upload LastBinaryResult property.
