	HIDDEN PROCEDURE numbytessent_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat Upload NumBytesSent property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            NumBytesSent_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the NumBytesSent property of the referenced Chilkat object.
