	PROCEDURE encodingmode_crypt2		&& Method run to validate the data for the Crypt2 EncodingMode property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            EncodingMode_Crypt2
		* Purpose:           Method run to validate the data for 
		*                    the Crypt2 EncodingMode property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tcValue, the value to validate
		*                    toChilkatWrapper, the object holding the property to set.
