	PROCEDURE smtpauthmethod		&& Method run to validate the data for the SMTPAuthMethod property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            SMTPAuthMethod
		* Purpose:           Method run to validate the data for the SMTPAuthMethod property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
