	HIDDEN PROCEDURE pingautorespond_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat WebSocket PingAutoRespond property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            PingAutoRespond_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat WebSocket PingAutoRespond property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.PingAutoRespond
		* Date Added:        07/06/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.70
		**
		** If 1, then a Pong frame is automatically sent when a Ping frame is received. 
		** If set to 0, then the application may check the NeedSendPong property 
		** to determine if a Pong response is needed, and if so, 
		** may call the SendPong method to send a Pong.
		** 
		** Note: If this property is 1, then the ReadFrame method will auto-consume 
		** incoming Ping frames. In other words, ReadFrame will continue with reading 
		** the next incoming frame (thus Ping frames will never be returned to the application). 
		** This relieves the application from having to worry about receiving 
		** and handling spurious Ping frames.
		** 
		** The default value is 1.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongBit]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 70
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

