	PROCEDURE polldataavailable		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.70. Check to see if data is available for reading on the websocket. Returns 1 if data is waiting and 0 if no data is waiting to be read.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            PollDataAvailable
