	PROCEDURE getnthchildwithtag		&& Returns the Nth child having a tag that matches exactly with the tagName. Use the NumChildrenHavingTag method to determine how many children have a particular tag. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            GetNthChildWithTag
		* Purpose:           Returns the Nth child having a tag that matches exactly with the tagName.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tcTagName -- the tag name to search.
		*                    tiIndex -- the index for the nth child.
