	PROCEDURE removechild		&& Removes all children with a given tag or tag path. Beginning in version 9.5.0.64, the tagPath can be a tag path. A tag path is a series of tags separated by vertical bar characters. For example: "tagA|tagB|tagC".
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            RemoveChild
		* Purpose:           Removes all children with a given tag or tag path.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
