		* Returns:           THIS.Selector
		* Date Added:        07/05/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.69
		** 
		** If the loaded XML contains multiple signatures, this property can be set 
		** to specify which signature is in effect when calling other methods or properties. 
		** In most cases, the loaded XML contains a single signature 
		** and this property will remain at the default value of 0.
