	PROCEDURE addexternalfileref		&& Introduced in version 9.5.0.69. Specifies an external file Reference to be added to the Signature when generated. The uri is the value of the URI attribute of the Reference.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            AddExternalFileRef
		* Purpose:           Specifies an enveloped Reference to be added to the Signature when generated. 
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        tcURI -- the URI attribute of the reference.
		*                    tcFilePath -- the path to the file on disk.
		*                    tcDigestMethod -- the digest method.
		*                    tcReferenceType -- the reference type (optional).
