		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.70
		**
		** The namespace URI for any InclusiveNamespaces elements that are created. 
		** The default value is "http://www.w3.org/2001/10/xml-exc-c14n#". 
		** For example, if the IncNamespacePrefix equals "ec" and this property 
