	HIDDEN PROCEDURE keyinfotype_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat XMLDSigGen KeyInfoType property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            KeyInfoType_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat XMLDSigGen KeyInfoType property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.KeyInfoType
		* Date Added:        07/05/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** Introduced in version 9.5.0.69
		**
		** Specifies the type of information that will be included 
		** in the optional KeyInfo element of the Signature. Possible values are:
		** 
		** None
		** KeyName
		** KeyValue
		** X509Data
		** X509Data+KeyValue
		** Custom
		** 
		** The default value is "KeyValue". The "X509Data+KeyValue" option was added in Chilkat v9.5.0.73.
		** 
		** If None, then no KeyInfo element is added to the Signature when generated.
		** 
		** If KeyValue, then the KeyInfo will contain the public key (RSA, DSA, or ECDSA).
		** 
		** If X509Data, then the KeyInfo will contain information 
		** about an X.509 certificate as specified by the X509Type property.
		** 
		** If Custom, then the KeyInfo will contain 
		** the custom XML contained in the CustomKeyInfoXml property.
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, ;
		lcProperty AS Character, lcMethodToCall AS Character
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1], la_IntroducedInBuild[3, 1]
		
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack, m.la_IntroducedInBuild
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [String]
		
		la_IntroducedInBuild[1] = 9
		la_IntroducedInBuild[2] = 5
		la_IntroducedInBuild[3] = 69
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, @m.la_IntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

