		* Date Added:        04/28/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** If 1, discards all file path information when zipping. The default value is 0.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
