	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE encryptpassword_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the EncryptPassword property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            EncryptPassword_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold 
		*                    the Chilkat ZIP EncryptPassword property.
