	HIDDEN PROCEDURE exeunzipdir_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat ZIP EXEUnZipDir property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            EXEUnzipDir_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat ZIP EXEUnzipDir property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.EXEUnzipDir
		* Date Added:        04/29/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		** 
		** (Relevant only when running on a Microsoft Windows operating system.) 
		** Applies to creating MS Windows self-extracting EXEs. 
		** Stores a pre-defined unzip directory within the self-extracting EXE 
		** so that it automatically unzips to this directory without user-intervention.
		**
		** Environment variables may be included if surrounded by percent characters. 
		** For example: %TEMP%. Environment variables are expanded (i.e. resolved) 
		** when the self-extracting EXE runs.
		**
		** Note: UNC paths, such as \\servername\path, are not supported.
		**
		** Note: To create a self-extracting EXE with no user-interaction, 
		** set the following properties to these values:
		** 
		** ExeSilentProgress  = 0<br>
		** ExeNoInterface = 1<br>
		** ExeFinishNotifier = 0
		** 
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [String]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

