	HIDDEN PROCEDURE exewaitforsetup_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat ZIP EXEWaitForSetup property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            EXEWaitForSetup_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat ZIP EXEWaitForSetup property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.EXEWaitForSetup
		* Date Added:        04/29/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** (Relevant only when running on a Microsoft Windows operating system.) 
		** If 1, the self-extracting EXE will wait for the AutoRun EXE 
		** to complete before it exits. 
		** If 0, the self-extracting EXE dialog 
		** (or process if running silently with no user-interface), 
		** is allowed to exit prior to the completion of the AutoRun EXE. 
		** The default value is 1.
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
