	PROCEDURE getentrybyname		&& Returns a ZipEntry by filename. If a full or partial path is part of the filename, this must be included in the filename parameter.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            GetEntryByName
		* Purpose:           Returns a ZipEntry by filename.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
