		** If a full or partial path is part of the filename, 
		** this must be included in the filename parameter.
		** 
		** Note: A problem with this method exists in v9.5.0.88 and v9.5.0.89. 
		** If the desired entry is not found, then the last entry is returned instead of null. 
		** If your application needs to use this method, Chilkat can provide a hotfix.
