	PROCEDURE insertnew		&& Inserts a new and empty entry into the Zip object. To insert at the beginning of the Zip, beforeIndex should be 0. The ZipEntry's FileName property is initialized to fileName parameter. Returns Nothing on failure.
		*==============================================================================
