		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Saves the Zip to a file and closes it. 
		** On return, the Zip object will be in the state as if NewZip had been called. 
		** There is no limitation on the size of files that may be contained within a .zip, 
		** the total number of files in a .zip, or the total size of a .zip. 
		** If necessary, WriteZip will use the ZIP64 file format extensions when 4GB 
		** or file count limitations of the old zip file format are exceeded.
