		#ENDIF .F.
		** End design time IntelliSense test
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE crc_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat ZIPEntry CRC property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            CRC_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat ZIPEntry CRC property.
