		* Date Added:        05/02/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** The CRC for the zip entry. For AES encrypted entries, 
		** the CRC value will be 0. (See http://www.winzip.com/aes_info.htm#CRC )
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
