	HIDDEN PROCEDURE entrytype_access		&& Access method used to retrieve the Chilkat ZIPEntry EntryType property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            EntryType_Access
		* Purpose:           Access method used to retrieve 
		*                    the Chilkat ZIPEntry EntryType property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights .oChilkat.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           THIS.EntryType
		* Date Added:        05/02/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Indicates the origin of the entry. There are five possible values:
		**
		** 0. Mapped Entry: An entry in an existing Zip file.
		** 1. File Entry: A file not yet in memory, but referenced. 
		** These entries are added by calling AppendFiles, AppendFilesEx, AppendOneFileOrDir, etc.
		** 2. Data Entry: An entry containing uncompressed data from memory. 
		** These entries are added by calling AppendData, AppendString, etc.
		** 3. Null Entry: An entry that no longer exists in the .zip.
		** 4. New Directory Entry: A directory entry added by calling AppendNewDir.
		**
		** When the zip is written by calling WriteZip or WriteToMemory, 
		** all of the zip entries are transformed into mapped entries. 
		** They become entries that contain the compressed data 
		** within the .zip that was just created. 
		** (The WriteZip method call effectively writes the zip and then opens it, 
		** replacing all of the existing entries with mapped entries.)
		**
		
		LOCAL liStackLevel AS Integer, lcMethod AS Character, lcProperty AS Character, ;
		lcMethodToCall AS Character, liIntroducedInBuild AS Integer
		
		LOCAL ARRAY la_Stack[1, 1]
		
		STORE 0 TO m.liStackLevel, m.liIntroducedInBuild
		STORE [] TO m.lcMethod, m.lcProperty, m.lcMethodToCall, m.la_Stack
		
		liStackLevel = ASTACKINFO(la_Stack)
		
		lcMethod = m.la_Stack(m.liStackLevel, 3)
		lcMethod = PROPER(SUBSTRC(m.lcMethod, AT_C([.], m.lcMethod) + 1))
		lcProperty = LEFTC(m.lcMethod, LENC(m.lcMethod) - 7)
		
		lcMethodToCall = [LongReadOnly]
		
		THIS.CallAccessObject(m.lcMethodToCall, m.liIntroducedInBuild)
		
		RETURN EVALUATE([THIS.] + m.lcProperty)
	ENDPROC

	HIDDEN PROCEDURE entrytype_assign		&& Assign method used to hold a reference to the EntryType property.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            EntryType_Assign
		* Purpose:           Assign method used to hold a reference to the EntryType property.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
