	PROCEDURE addfilesend		&& Fired at the end of the AppendFiles or AppendFilesEx method.
		*==============================================================================
		* Method:            AddFilesEnd
		* Purpose:           Fired at the end of the AppendFiles or AppendFilesEx method.
		* Author:            Bill Anderson
		* Notice:            Copyright (c) 2022 - 2026 The Anderson Files LLC, All Rights Reserved.
		* Parameters:        
		* Returns:           
		* Date Added:        10/22/2022
		*==============================================================================
		
		**
		** Fired at the end of the AppendFiles or AppendFilesEx method.
		**
		
		LOCAL llReturn AS Logical
		
		llReturn = .T.
		
		*!*  ? [AddFilesEnd Event!]
		
		WITH THIS
		
		  llReturn = .AddFilesEnd_Pre()
		
		  ** OK to continue test
		  IF m.llReturn
		
		    llReturn = .AddFilesEnd_Process()
		
		    ** OK to continue test
		    IF m.llReturn
		
		      llReturn = .AddFilesEnd_Post()
		
		    ENDIF m.llReturn 
		    ** End OK to continue test
		
		  ENDIF m.llReturn 
		  ** End OK to continue test
		
		ENDWITH
		
		RETURN
	ENDPROC

